        "text_nc39NF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Successful Expansion",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Once Damian’s invention proved useful, he turned his creative focus to other areas of construction and masonry markets, eventually releasing the Mud Hog®, Uphill Grout Hog®, Hog Slopper®, Hog Legs®, Hog Trough® and Booger Hog®. In the early 2000’s Damian broke into the fencing industry with the introduction of the Fence Hog® – which now includes several models designed to save contractors thousands of dollars and man hours required to complete jobs.</p>",
            "desktop_content_position": "start-md",
            "desktop_content_alignment": "ta-left-md top-md",
            "desktop_column": "2",
            "desktop_row": "2",
            "mobile_content_position": "center-xs",
            "mobile_content_alignment": "ta-left top-xs",
            "mobile_column": "1",
            "mobile_row": "2",
            "button_label": "",
